  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fourth phase of CoC and Girls Shine project. The CO have received feedback from UNFPA that the project budget will go up to $1.5 million. The budget has decreased to BDT100,274,691 and running for a period of 1 Jan - 30 Sept 2025. A top-up was verbally agreed for Q4 when UNFPA gets approved funding.</narrative>
